error[SC0411]: `p` may be read before anything was assigned to it
   ╭─[ a_pointer_assigned_on_one_arm_may_be_read_before_it_is.c:9:5 ]
   │
 9 │     free(p);
   │     ───┬───  
   │        ╰───── not assigned on every path here
───╯
  = note: C17 6.3.2.1 p2: reading a local whose address is never taken before it is assigned is undefined, whatever the value is read for
  = note: this check belongs to safety level 1
  = note: this could not be proven, and unproven results are errors in this compilation
  = help: assign it where it is declared, `= 0` if nothing else
